---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";

const pageTitle = "About Erik Rutledge | Rutledge Digital";
const pageDescription = "Get to know Erik Rutledge, the person behind Rutledge Digital, and learn about his approach to building better websites for small businesses.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  <section class="hero section-wrap">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow"><span class="status-dot"></span> THE PERSON BEHIND RUTLEDGE DIGITAL</p>
      <h1>Hey, I’m Erik.<br /><span class="accent">I make the web work for you.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-lede">I’m the founder of Rutledge Digital. I work with businesses to turn ideas, challenges, and big plans into useful, thoughtful websites. I am passionate about small business, local community, and providing a service or product that you are passionate about.</p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Let’s work together <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
        <a class="button button-quiet" href="#my-approach">How I work <span aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-proof"><span>Owner & developer</span><span>Based in Utah</span><span>Built around your goals</span></div>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-art" aria-label="Portrait of Erik Rutledge">
      <img src="/images/erik-rutledge.jpg" alt="Portrait of Erik Rutledge" width="100%" height="350" />
      <span class="art-label label-top">ERIK RUTLEDGE</span>
      <span class="art-label label-bottom">FOUNDER · RUTLEDGE DIGITAL</span>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-band">
    <div class="section-wrap intro-grid">
      <p class="eyebrow">A QUICK INTRODUCTION</p>
      <p class="intro-statement">Good work starts with understanding people. <span>Before I think about pages, features, or code, I want to understand the person behind the business and what they’re trying to accomplish.</span></p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap section-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">MY STORY</p><h2>How I got<br />to doing this.</h2></div>
      <p class="note-panel">Use this space to tell the story behind your work—where you started, what drew you to web development, and what keeps you interested.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-row">
      <span class="service-index">01</span>
      <div>
        <h2>Every business has a story. Here’s a little of mine.</h2>
        <p>[Add a few paragraphs about your background, how you got into technology or web development, and what led you to start Rutledge Digital.]</p>
        <p>[Share a turning point, a lesson you learned, or a moment when you realized you wanted to help businesses improve their online presence.]</p>
      </div>
      <span class="service-icon" aria-hidden="true">↗</span>
    </div>
    <div class="note-panel">
      <p class="eyebrow">A NOTE TO CLIENTS</p>
      <h2>“[Add a personal motto, a belief about good work, or a sentence that sums up what matters to you.]”</h2>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="intro-band" id="my-approach">
    <div class="section-wrap section-block">
      <div class="section-heading">
        <div><p class="eyebrow">MY APPROACH</p><h2>What you can<br />expect from me.</h2></div>
        <p class="hero-lede">A few principles that shape how I work with clients. Edit these to reflect your actual process and values.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="service-grid">
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">01 / LISTEN</span><div class="service-icon">◎</div><h3>Understand first</h3><p>[Explain how you learn about a client’s business, audience, priorities, and challenges before recommending a solution.]</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">02 / BUILD</span><div class="service-icon">↗</div><h3>Make it purposeful</h3><p>[Describe how you balance design, usability, performance, and the practical needs of a business.]</p></article>
        <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">03 / SUPPORT</span><div class="service-icon">⟳</div><h3>Stay in your corner</h3><p>[Share what communication, collaboration, handoff, or ongoing support looks like when working with you.]</p></article>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap section-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">OUTSIDE THE SCREEN</p><h2>A few things that make me, <span class="accent">me.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="hero-lede">Business is personal, too. Give visitors a glimpse of the human behind the work.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-grid">
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">01 / WHEN I’M NOT CODING</span><div class="service-icon">↗</div><h3>[A hobby or interest]</h3><p>[Tell a short story about what you enjoy outside of work, and why it matters to you.]</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">02 / CURRENTLY INTO</span><div class="service-icon">◈</div><h3>[Something you’re learning]</h3><p>[A book, skill, project, or topic you’re excited about lately.]</p></article>
      <article class="service-card"><span class="service-index">03 / A FUN FACT</span><div class="service-icon">◎</div><h3>[Something unexpected]</h3><p>[A memorable, funny, or surprising detail clients might enjoy knowing about you.]</p></article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section-wrap section-block">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <div><p class="eyebrow">WHO I WORK BEST WITH</p><h2>Good people.<br /><span class="accent">Good problems to solve.</span></h2></div>
      <p class="hero-lede">[Describe the kinds of clients you enjoy partnering with, the problems you’re especially good at solving, or the goals that get you excited.]</p>
    </div>
    <div class="service-list">
      <div class="service-row"><span class="service-index">01</span><div><h2>[A type of business or client you serve]</h2><p>[Add a little detail about the clients you most enjoy working with.]</p></div></div>
      <div class="service-row"><span class="service-index">02</span><div><h2>[A challenge you love helping solve]</h2><p>[Describe a common problem you can help a business overcome.]</p></div></div>
      <div class="service-row"><span class="service-index">03</span><div><h2>[A result you want clients to get]</h2><p>[Explain what you want clients to walk away with after working with you.]</p></div></div>
    </div>
    <p>Don’t see yourself in this list? <a class="text-link" href="/contact/">Tell me what you have in mind <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a></p>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <div class="section-wrap cta-content">
      <p class="eyebrow">YOUR TURN</p>
      <h2>Tell me a little<br /><span class="accent">about your business.</span></h2>
      <p class="hero-lede cta-lede">Have a project in mind, a challenge to solve, or just a few questions? I’d be glad to hear from you.</p>
      <a class="button button-primary" href="/contact/">Let’s start a conversation <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
